# Next segment config + dynamic SSR

`next build` fails on the origin if these are wrong (seen on Next 16.3.2 / Turbopack).

- `export const revalidate` in `page`/`layout` must be a numeric literal or `false` (`86400`, not `STOREFRONT_REVALIDATE_SECONDS`). Use the imported constant only for `fetch` / `unstable_cache` options.
- `export const dynamic` must be a string literal (`"force-static"`, `"force-dynamic"`).
- Do not pass `{ ssr: false }` to `next/dynamic` from a Server Component under `src/app`. Put that import in a `"use client"` file under `src/components`.
